# Wardlights language keys
# Item, tooltip and config keys are added here as content is implemented.
#
# All text colors live here, not in the code. Formatting codes (§ + character):
#   §0 black      §1 dark blue   §2 dark green  §3 dark aqua   §4 dark red    §5 dark purple
#   §6 gold       §7 gray        §8 dark gray   §9 blue        §a green       §b aqua
#   §c red        §d light purple §e yellow     §f white
#   §l bold  §o italic  §n underline  §m strikethrough  §k obfuscated  §r reset
# A color code also resets bold/italic, so put the color first: §6§l = bold gold.
# After a highlighted %s, switch back to the line's own color (e.g. §3%s§6).

